<title>SPAIN: Telefonica ends at record high after deal.</title>
<headline>Telefonica ends at record high after deal.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Telefonica de Espana SA, which earlier announced an alliance with British Telecommunications and U.S.-based MCI, ended up 30 pesetas on Friday at a record closing high of 3,595 pesetas.</p>
<p>Dealers and analysts said the deal should support the share long-term, as it opens the door to U.S. Spanish speakers for Telefonica.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
